def bell_Number(n):
    """Return the nth Bell number."""
    # Initialize Bell numbers dictionary
    bell_numbers = {0: 1, 1: 1}

    # Helper function to compute Bell numbers
    def computeBellNumber(k):
        if k not in bell_numbers:
            bell_numbers[k] = computeBellNumber(k-1) + computeBellNumber(k-2)
        return bell_numbers[k]

    # Compute Bell numbers iteratively up to n
    if n <= 0:
        return 0
    elif n == 1:
        return 1
    else:
        return computeBellNumber(n)
```

